Hello OpenStack community,

I would like to announce my candidacy for PTL of Designate for the
2027.1 cycle.

I've been a Designate contributor for over 2 years and served as PTL
and core reviewer since the 2025.2 cycle.

My focus for the 2027.1 cycle will continue to be reducing the open
bugs and improving the overall stability and reliability of Designate,
and I hope we can also make progress on improving the Neutron-DNS
integration.

Thank you for your support and your consideration for 2027.1,

Omer Schwartz (oschwart)
